# Config file reference

<!-- Generated by scripts/gen_config_docs.py from src/wot_toolchain/schemas/config.yaml. Edit the schema, not this page. -->

A project describes what to generate in a YAML config file, by default `wot-toolchain.yaml` in the current directory (select another with `-c`).
When the file is loaded it is validated against the LinkML schema `src/wot_toolchain/schemas/config.yaml`, from which this page is generated.
Relative paths in the file are resolved against the directory of the config file.

The top level of the file is [`{{ schemaview.tree_root.name if schemaview.tree_root else "Config" }}`](#config). The repository's own [`wot-toolchain.yaml`](https://github.com/w3c/wot-thing-description-toolchain-tmp/blob/main/wot-toolchain.yaml) is a complete example.
